WEBVTT

00:24:26.708 --> 00:24:31.893
and now, what has happened
over the last seven, eight years

00:24:31.917 --> 00:24:33.809
and through history,

00:24:33.833 --> 00:24:35.833
we have to change course.

00:24:37.625 --> 00:24:42.184
And we all have to participate
in changing America

00:24:42.208 --> 00:24:44.518
with the true revolution of values,

00:24:44.542 --> 00:24:47.601
where people are at the center,

00:24:47.625 --> 00:24:49.309
and not profit.

00:24:49.333 --> 00:24:51.809
Where morality is at the center,

00:24:51.833 --> 00:24:54.500
and not our military might.

00:24:55.375 --> 00:24:59.083
America does have a choice.